# Local opencode config (machine-local agent policy, plugin file-config).
# Contents are ignored rather than the directory: git will not descend into an
# excluded directory, so a negation below it would never match. The plugin is
# registered globally instead, as a link in ~/.config/opencode/plugins/.
.opencode/*

